<title>PHILIPPINES: Far Eastern sets 15 peso cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Far Eastern sets 15 peso cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' Far Eastern University said on Thursday its board had approved a 15 peso cash dividend to shareholders as of January 10.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on January 21.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
